      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 260683,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Key invariants\n• Transaction is the common atomic parent for financial postings and bucket effects.\n• Source/destination accounts are represented by signed postings; origin means manual/import/rule/system.\n• Every BucketEntry names a bucket; its optional category classifies that exact amount.\n• Ordinary bucket entries total the financial coverage change; bucket transfers are uncategorized and sum to zero.\n• Reconciled postings are corrected by reversal, not silent mutation.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Key invariants\n• Transaction is the common atomic parent for financial postings and bucket effects.\n• Source/destination accounts are represented by signed postings; origin means manual/import/rule/system.\n• Every BucketEntry names a bucket; its optional category classifies that exact amount.\n• Ordinary bucket entries total the financial coverage change; bucket transfers are uncategorized and sum to zero.\n• Reconciled postings are corrected by reversal, not silent mutation.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    }
  ],
